ildren":["To sustainably drive our customers' success by simplifying their fastener supply chain and supporting them in their technical requirements through our world-class engineering and manufacturing capabilities."]},{"type":"p","children":["For more information, visit:"]},{"type":"p","children":["TRIFAST PLC TRI Stock | London Stock Exchange"]},{"type":"p","children":["website: www.trifast.com"]},{"type":"p","children":["LinkedIn www.linkedin.com/company/tr-fastenings"]},{"type":"p","children":["Trifast, TR and TR Fastenings are registered trademarks of the Company"]},{"type":"p","children":["LEI number: 213800WFIVE6RWK3CR22"]}]}]},"This information is provided by RNS, the news service of the London Stock Exchange. RNS is approved by the Financial Conduct Authority to act as a Primary Information Provider in the United Kingdom. Terms and conditions relating to the use and distribution of this information may apply. For further information, please contact rns@lseg.com or visit www.rns.com.",{"type":"p","children":["RNS may use your IP address to confirm compliance with the terms and conditions, to analyse how you engage with the information contained in this communication, and to share such analysis on an anonymised basis with others as part of our commercial services. For further information about how RNS and the London Stock Exchange use the personal data you provide us, please see our Privacy Policy.   END  RAGFLFSFADITIIR"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Dividends","args":[{"id":"section","value":"dividends"}]},{"title":"London Stock Exchange","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"lse"}]},{"title":"Management","args":[{"id":"section","value":"management"}]},{"title":"UK stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"GB"}]}],"copyright":"Copyright 2019 Regulatory News Service, all rights reserved","id":"tag:reuters.com,2026-09-08:newsml_RSH8954Ta:0","title":"REG - Trifast PLC - Result of AGM","published":1788871770,"urgency